From: Nokcandu compatibility integration
Subject: winemac: Restore Metal client-surface presentation notifications on Wine 11.

Port of CodeWeavers CrossOver 26.3.0's LGPL-2.1-or-later CW HACK 22435
(d3dmetal_objc.m/.h, event handling and backing-layer selection), with
Nokcandu integration for the scaled inner layer, explicit queued-event
surface ownership, and the ExtEscape surface association.
Source: https://media.codeweavers.com/pub/crossover/source/crossover-sources-26.3.0.tar.gz
SHA256: ac99c8ca4b3848f3e81784135f023df266b61c2345726ea55a50b3e030dd6872
Original CodeWeavers copyright and LGPL notices retained in new files.

